Package: RDML7
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Real-Time PCR (qPCR) Data and RDML Files
Version: 1.0
LazyData: true
Date: 2026-08-26
Encoding: UTF-8
Description: Reads, writes, validates, converts, and manipulates quantitative PCR
    data using Real-time PCR Data Markup Language (RDML) S7 objects. Includes
    an extensible file-format registry, vendor/table importers, RDES import and
    export, fluorescence-table helpers, semantic validation, and compatibility
    wrappers for the historical RDML API.
